perf(my-copilot): deduplicate OBO token exchange per request

backendRequest exchanged a new OBO token on every call (~15 per
statistikk page view). Add in-flight promise deduplication so
concurrent calls for the same user token share a single exchange.

Unlike React.cache (server-component only), this works in both
RSC pages and API Route Handlers.
