fix(my-copilot): fix Faro init guard for SDK 2.5.0

faro.api is pre-populated as a stub in @grafana/faro-web-sdk 2.5.0,
so the 'if (faro.api) return' guard always returned early, preventing
initializeFaro from ever being called. Use faro.config instead, which
is only set after actual initialization.
