fix(nav-pilot): always fetch latest content from main

Previously, released binaries would clone from their own release tag,
meaning new skills/agents added after the binary was built would not be
available. Now always clones HEAD of main to get the latest content.

Users can still pin to a specific version with --ref if needed.
